WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.300
[Upbeat instrumental music]
“Trivia was too calm.”

00:02.300 --> 00:04.800
TRIVIALISE! logo and three mascot tokens.

00:04.800 --> 00:07.600
Pick your question: easy, medium or hard.
Rewards: 1, 3 or 5 spaces.

00:07.600 --> 00:10.600
“Trivia earns progress.”
A token hops along a branching board.

00:10.600 --> 00:13.500
“Everyone else · buzz now.”
“Steal!”

00:13.500 --> 00:16.800
“One card can change the story.”
A Double Draw card flips into view.

00:16.800 --> 00:20.000
TRIVIALISE! logo.
“Tension. Answer. Reveal. Hop. Chaos.”
